          "id": 1483728675,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "To confirm my understanding is correct, would you recommend instead something like this?\n\n```cpp\nurl = QString(WS_DOCS_URL \"dfref/%1/%2.html\")\n      .arg(proto_abbrev[0])\n      .arg(proto_abbrev);\n\nif (protocol_field_selected)\n{\n    const QString proto_field_abbrev = proto_registrar_get_abbrev(finfo.headerInfo().id);\n    url.append(QString(\"#%1\").arg(proto_field_abbrev);\n}\n```\n\nGiven the conditional need for the # character, I don't see a way to do this without an if statement.",
